 ## Purpose
 
-Orchestrator for the full Dev lifecycle: Plan → Implement → Test → Document. Delegates to each phase skill in order, stopping at every phase boundary for developer confirmation.
+The full dev lifecycle in one skill: Context Gathering → Ceremony → Plan →
+Implement → Test → Document. Routes to each stage reference in order (or directly
+to one stage, on request), stopping at every phase boundary for developer
+confirmation. Replaces the former separate `dev-plan`, `dev-implement`, `dev-test`,
+`dev-document` skills — those stages now live under this one skill's `references/`.
+Context Gathering and Ceremony are new: Context Gathering captures the ticket's
+intent once (from the tracker, any approved design, and the developer's own words)
+as `intent.md`, before any tracker/branch ceremony or plan-writing begins.
 
